#: check.c:120
msgid "Checking for system-defined composite types in user tables"
msgstr "正在检查用户表中的系统定义复合类型"

#: check.c:127
msgid ""
"Your installation contains system-defined composite types in user tables.\n"
"These type OIDs are not stable across PostgreSQL versions,\n"
"so this cluster cannot currently be upgraded.  You can drop the\n"
"problem columns and restart the upgrade.\n"
msgstr ""
"您的安装在用户表中包含系统定义的复合类型。\n"
"这些类型的 OID 在不同 PostgreSQL 版本间并不稳定，\n"
"因此当前不能升级此集簇。可以删除有问题的列，然后重新开始升级。\n"

#: check.c:141
msgid "Checking for incompatible \"line\" data type"
msgstr "正在检查不兼容的 \"line\" 数据类型"

#: check.c:146
msgid ""
"Your installation contains the \"line\" data type in user tables.\n"
"This data type changed its internal and input/output format\n"
"between your old and new versions so this\n"
"cluster cannot currently be upgraded.  You can\n"
"drop the problem columns and restart the upgrade.\n"
msgstr ""
"您的安装在用户表中包含 \"line\" 数据类型。\n"
"该数据类型的内部格式及输入/输出格式在旧版本与新版本之间已发生变化，\n"
"因此当前不能升级此集簇。可以删除有问题的列，然后重新开始升级。\n"

#: check.c:163
msgid "Checking for reg* data types in user tables"
msgstr "正在检查用户表中的 reg* 数据类型"

#: check.c:191
msgid ""
"Your installation contains one of the reg* data types in user tables.\n"
"These data types reference system OIDs that are not preserved by\n"
"pg_upgrade, so this cluster cannot currently be upgraded.  You can\n"
"drop the problem columns and restart the upgrade.\n"
msgstr ""
"您的安装在用户表中包含某种 reg* 数据类型。\n"
"这些数据类型引用 pg_upgrade 不会保留的系统 OID，\n"
"因此当前不能升级此集簇。可以删除有问题的列，然后重新开始升级。\n"

#: check.c:203
msgid "Checking for incompatible \"aclitem\" data type"
msgstr "正在检查不兼容的 \"aclitem\" 数据类型"

#: check.c:208
msgid ""
"Your installation contains the \"aclitem\" data type in user tables.\n"
"The internal format of \"aclitem\" changed in PostgreSQL version 16\n"
"so this cluster cannot currently be upgraded.  You can drop the\n"
"problem columns and restart the upgrade.\n"
msgstr ""
"您的安装在用户表中包含 \"aclitem\" 数据类型。\n"
"\"aclitem\" 的内部格式在 PostgreSQL 16 中已发生变化，\n"
"因此当前不能升级此集簇。可以删除有问题的列，然后重新开始升级。\n"

#: check.c:227
msgid "Checking for invalid \"unknown\" user columns"
msgstr "正在检查无效的 \"unknown\" 用户列"

#: check.c:232
msgid ""
"Your installation contains the \"unknown\" data type in user tables.\n"
"This data type is no longer allowed in tables, so this cluster\n"
"cannot currently be upgraded.  You can drop the problem columns\n"
"and restart the upgrade.\n"
msgstr ""
"您的安装在用户表中包含 \"unknown\" 数据类型。\n"
"表中已不再允许使用此数据类型，因此当前不能升级此集簇。\n"
"可以删除有问题的列，然后重新开始升级。\n"

#: check.c:249
msgid "Checking for invalid \"sql_identifier\" user columns"
msgstr "正在检查无效的 \"sql_identifier\" 用户列"

#: check.c:254
msgid ""
"Your installation contains the \"sql_identifier\" data type in user tables.\n"
"The on-disk format for this data type has changed, so this\n"
"cluster cannot currently be upgraded.  You can drop the problem\n"
"columns and restart the upgrade.\n"
msgstr ""
"您的安装在用户表中包含 \"sql_identifier\" 数据类型。\n"
"该数据类型的磁盘格式已更改，因此当前不能升级此集簇。\n"
"可以删除有问题的列，然后重新开始升级。\n"

#: check.c:265
msgid "Checking for incompatible \"jsonb\" data type in user tables"
msgstr "正在检查用户表中不兼容的 \"jsonb\" 数据类型"

#: check.c:270
msgid ""
"Your installation contains the \"jsonb\" data type in user tables.\n"
"The internal format of \"jsonb\" changed during 9.4 beta so this\n"
"cluster cannot currently be upgraded.  You can drop the problem \n"
"columns and restart the upgrade.\n"
msgstr ""
"您的安装在用户表中包含 \"jsonb\" 数据类型。\n"
"\"jsonb\" 的内部格式在 9.4 beta 期间已发生变化，\n"
"因此当前不能升级此集簇。可以删除有问题的列，然后重新开始升级。\n"

#: check.c:282
msgid "Checking for removed \"abstime\" data type in user tables"
msgstr "正在检查用户表中已移除的 \"abstime\" 数据类型"

#: check.c:287
msgid ""
"Your installation contains the \"abstime\" data type in user tables.\n"
"The \"abstime\" type has been removed in PostgreSQL version 12,\n"
"so this cluster cannot currently be upgraded.  You can drop the\n"
"problem columns, or change them to another data type, and restart\n"
"the upgrade.\n"
msgstr ""
"您的安装在用户表中包含 \"abstime\" 数据类型。\n"
"PostgreSQL 12 已移除 \"abstime\" 类型，因此当前不能升级此集簇。\n"
"可以删除有问题的列，或将其改为其他数据类型，然后重新开始升级。\n"

#: check.c:295
msgid "Checking for removed \"reltime\" data type in user tables"
msgstr "正在检查用户表中已移除的 \"reltime\" 数据类型"

#: check.c:300
msgid ""
"Your installation contains the \"reltime\" data type in user tables.\n"
"The \"reltime\" type has been removed in PostgreSQL version 12,\n"
"so this cluster cannot currently be upgraded.  You can drop the\n"
"problem columns, or change them to another data type, and restart\n"
"the upgrade.\n"
msgstr ""
"您的安装在用户表中包含 \"reltime\" 数据类型。\n"
"PostgreSQL 12 已移除 \"reltime\" 类型，因此当前不能升级此集簇。\n"
"可以删除有问题的列，或将其改为其他数据类型，然后重新开始升级。\n"

#: check.c:308
msgid "Checking for removed \"tinterval\" data type in user tables"
msgstr "正在检查用户表中已移除的 \"tinterval\" 数据类型"

#: check.c:313
msgid ""
"Your installation contains the \"tinterval\" data type in user tables.\n"
"The \"tinterval\" type has been removed in PostgreSQL version 12,\n"
"so this cluster cannot currently be upgraded.  You can drop the\n"
"problem columns, or change them to another data type, and restart\n"
"the upgrade.\n"
msgstr ""
"您的安装在用户表中包含 \"tinterval\" 数据类型。\n"
"PostgreSQL 12 已移除 \"tinterval\" 类型，因此当前不能升级此集簇。\n"
"可以删除有问题的列，或将其改为其他数据类型，然后重新开始升级。\n"

