#: check.c:480
#, c-format
msgid "Checking data type usage"
msgstr "正在检查数据类型使用情况"

#: check.c:534
#, c-format
msgid "Data type checks failed: %s"
msgstr "数据类型检查失败: %s"

#: check.c:583
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Performing Consistency Checks on Old Live Server\n"
"------------------------------------------------"
msgstr ""
"正在对运行中的旧服务器执行一致性检查\n"
"------------------------------------------------"

#: check.c:589
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Performing Consistency Checks\n"
"-----------------------------"
msgstr ""
"正在执行一致性检查\n"
"-----------------------------"

#: check.c:790
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Swap mode can only upgrade clusters from PostgreSQL version %s and later."
msgstr "交换模式只能升级 PostgreSQL %s 及更高版本的集簇。"

#: check.c:813
#, c-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"*Clusters are compatible*"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"*集簇兼容*"

#: check.c:821
#, c-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"If pg_upgrade fails after this point, you must re-initdb the\n"
"new cluster before continuing."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"如果 pg_upgrade 在此之后失败，必须重新对新集簇执行 initdb，\n"
"然后才能继续。"

#: check.c:862
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Some statistics are not transferred by pg_upgrade.\n"
"Once you start the new server, consider running these two commands:\n"
"    %s/vacuumdb %s--all --analyze-in-stages --missing-stats-only\n"
"    %s/vacuumdb %s--all --analyze-only"
msgstr ""
"pg_upgrade 不会传输部分统计信息。\n"
"启动新服务器后，考虑运行以下两个命令:\n"
"    %s/vacuumdb %s--all --analyze-in-stages --missing-stats-only\n"
"    %s/vacuumdb %s--all --analyze-only"

#: check.c:871
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Running this script will delete the old cluster's data files:\n"
"    %s"
msgstr ""
"运行此脚本将删除旧集簇的数据文件:\n"
"    %s"

#: check.c:876
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Could not create a script to delete the old cluster's data files\n"
"because user-defined tablespaces or the new cluster's data directory\n"
"exist in the old cluster directory.  The old cluster's contents must\n"
"be deleted manually."
msgstr ""
"无法创建删除旧集簇数据文件的脚本，\n"
"因为用户定义的表空间或新集簇的数据目录\n"
"位于旧集簇目录内。必须手动删除\n"
"旧集簇的内容。"

#: check.c:888
#, c-format
msgid "Checking cluster versions"
msgstr "正在检查集簇版本"

#: check.c:900
#, c-format
msgid "This utility can only upgrade from PostgreSQL version %s and later."
msgstr "此工具只能从 PostgreSQL %s 及更高版本升级。"

#: check.c:905
#, c-format
msgid "This utility can only upgrade to PostgreSQL version %s."
msgstr "此工具只能升级到 PostgreSQL %s。"

#: check.c:914
#, c-format
msgid ""
"This utility cannot be used to downgrade to older major PostgreSQL versions."
msgstr "此工具不能用于降级到较旧的 PostgreSQL 主版本。"

#: check.c:919
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Old cluster data and binary directories are from different major versions."
msgstr "旧集簇的数据目录与可执行文件目录来自不同的主版本。"

#: check.c:922
#, c-format
msgid ""
"New cluster data and binary directories are from different major versions."
msgstr "新集簇的数据目录与可执行文件目录来自不同的主版本。"

#: check.c:933
#, c-format
msgid "The option %s cannot be used for upgrades from PostgreSQL %s and later."
msgstr "从 PostgreSQL %2$s 及更高版本升级时不能使用选项 %1$s。"

#: check.c:949
#, c-format
msgid ""
"When checking a live server, the old and new port numbers must be different."
msgstr "检查运行中的服务器时，新旧端口号必须不同。"

#: check.c:969
#, c-format
msgid "New cluster database \"%s\" is not empty: found relation \"%s.%s\""
msgstr "新集簇数据库 \"%s\" 不为空: 发现关系 \"%s.%s\""

#: check.c:992
#, c-format
msgid "Checking new cluster tablespace directories"
msgstr "正在检查新集簇的表空间目录"

#: check.c:1003
#, c-format
msgid "new cluster tablespace directory already exists: \"%s\""
msgstr "新集簇的表空间目录已存在: \"%s\""

#: check.c:1037
#, c-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"WARNING:  new data directory should not be inside the old data directory, "
"i.e. %s"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"警告:  新数据目录不宜位于旧数据目录内，即 %s"

#: check.c:1061
#, c-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"WARNING:  user-defined tablespace locations should not be inside the data "
"directory, i.e. %s"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"警告:  用户定义的表空间位置不宜位于数据目录内，即 %s"

#: check.c:1071
#, c-format
msgid "Creating script to delete old cluster"
msgstr "正在创建删除旧集簇的脚本"

#: check.c:1099
#, c-format
msgid "could not add execute permission to file \"%s\": %m"
msgstr "无法为文件 \"%s\" 添加执行权限: %m"

#: check.c:1119
#, c-format
msgid "Checking database user is the install user"
msgstr "正在检查数据库用户是否为安装用户"

#: check.c:1135
#, c-format
msgid "database user \"%s\" is not the install user"
msgstr "数据库用户 \"%s\" 不是安装用户"

#: check.c:1146
#, c-format
msgid "could not determine the number of users"
msgstr "无法确定用户数量"

#: check.c:1154
#, c-format
msgid "Only the install user can be defined in the new cluster."
msgstr "新集簇中只能定义安装用户。"

#: check.c:1184
#, c-format
msgid "Checking database connection settings"
msgstr "正在检查数据库连接设置"

#: check.c:1212
#, c-format
msgid ""
"template0 must not allow connections, i.e. its pg_database.datallowconn must "
"be false"
msgstr "template0 不得允许连接，即其 pg_database.datallowconn 必须为 false"

#: check.c:1239 check.c:1300 check.c:1415 check.c:1508 check.c:1633
#: check.c:1707 check.c:1790 check.c:1865 check.c:1923 check.c:2003
#: check.c:2355 check.c:2511 check.c:2651 check.c:2720 function.c:235
#, c-format
msgid "fatal"
msgstr "致命错误"

#: check.c:1240
#, c-format
msgid ""
"All non-template0 databases must allow connections, i.e. their\n"
"pg_database.datallowconn must be true and pg_database.datconnlimit\n"
"must not be -2.  Your installation contains non-template0 databases\n"
"which cannot be connected to.  Consider allowing connection for all\n"
"non-template0 databases or drop the databases which do not allow\n"
"connections.  A list of databases with the problem is in the file:\n"
"    %s"
msgstr ""
"除 template0 外的所有数据库都必须允许连接，即其\n"
"pg_database.datallowconn 必须为 true，pg_database.datconnlimit\n"
"不得为 -2。您的安装中存在不能连接的非 template0 数据库。\n"
"考虑允许连接所有非 template0 数据库，\n"
"或删除不允许连接的数据库。\n"
"有问题的数据库列在以下文件中:\n"
"    %s"

#: check.c:1267
#, c-format
msgid "Checking for unsupported encodings"
msgstr "正在检查不支持的编码"

#: check.c:1301
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Your installation contains databases using encodings that are\n"
"no longer supported.  Consider dumping and restoring with UTF8.\n"
"A list of databases with unsupported encodings is in the file:\n"
"    %s"
msgstr ""
"您的安装中有数据库使用已不再支持的编码。\n"
"可以考虑转储后使用 UTF8 恢复。\n"
"使用不支持的编码的数据库列在以下文件中:\n"
"    %s"

#: check.c:1323
#, c-format
msgid "Checking for prepared transactions"
msgstr "正在检查预备事务"

#: check.c:1332
#, c-format
msgid "The source cluster contains prepared transactions"
msgstr "源集簇包含预备事务"

#: check.c:1334
#, c-format
msgid "The target cluster contains prepared transactions"
msgstr "目标集簇包含预备事务"

#: check.c:1391
#, c-format
msgid "Checking for contrib/isn with bigint-passing mismatch"
msgstr "正在检查 contrib/isn 的 bigint 参数传递方式是否不匹配"

#: check.c:1416
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Your installation contains \"contrib/isn\" functions which rely on the\n"
"bigint data type.  Your old and new clusters pass bigint values\n"
"differently so this cluster cannot currently be upgraded.  You can\n"
"manually dump databases in the old cluster that use \"contrib/isn\"\n"
"facilities, drop them, perform the upgrade, and then restore them.  A\n"
"list of the problem functions is in the file:\n"
"    %s"
msgstr ""
"您的安装有依赖 bigint 数据类型的 \"contrib/isn\" 函数。\n"
"新旧集簇传递 bigint 值的方式不同，因此当前不能升级此集簇。\n"
"可以手动转储旧集簇中使用 \"contrib/isn\" 功能的数据库，\n"
"删除这些数据库，执行升级，然后将其恢复。\n"
"有问题的函数列在以下文件中:\n"
"    %s"

#: check.c:1493
#, c-format
msgid "Checking for user-defined postfix operators"
msgstr "正在检查用户定义的后缀操作符"

#: check.c:1509
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Your installation contains user-defined postfix operators, which are not\n"
"supported anymore.  Consider dropping the postfix operators and replacing\n"
"them with prefix operators or function calls.\n"
"A list of user-defined postfix operators is in the file:\n"
"    %s"
msgstr ""
"您的安装包含已不再受支持的\n"
"用户定义后缀操作符。考虑删除这些后缀操作符，并用\n"
"前缀操作符或函数调用替代。\n"
"用户定义的后缀操作符列在以下文件中:\n"
"    %s"

#: check.c:1561
#, c-format
msgid "Checking for incompatible polymorphic functions"
msgstr "正在检查不兼容的多态函数"

#: check.c:1634
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Your installation contains user-defined objects that refer to internal\n"
"polymorphic functions with arguments of type \"anyarray\" or "
"\"anyelement\".\n"
"These user-defined objects must be dropped before upgrading and restored\n"
"afterwards, changing them to refer to the new corresponding functions with\n"
"arguments of type \"anycompatiblearray\" and \"anycompatible\".\n"
"A list of the problematic objects is in the file:\n"
"    %s"
msgstr ""
"您的安装包含引用内部多态函数的用户定义对象，\n"
"这些函数的参数类型为 \"anyarray\" 或 \"anyelement\"。\n"
"必须在升级前删除这些用户定义对象，并在升级后恢复，\n"
"同时将其改为引用相应的新函数，\n"
"新函数的参数类型为 \"anycompatiblearray\" 和 \"anycompatible\"。\n"
"有问题的对象列在以下文件中:\n"
"    %s"

#: check.c:1692
#, c-format
msgid "Checking for tables WITH OIDS"
msgstr "正在检查使用 WITH OIDS 的表"

#: check.c:1708
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Your installation contains tables declared WITH OIDS, which is not\n"
"supported anymore.  Consider removing the oid column using\n"
"    ALTER TABLE ... SET WITHOUT OIDS;\n"
"A list of tables with the problem is in the file:\n"
"    %s"
msgstr ""
"您的安装包含以 WITH OIDS 声明的表，此方式已\n"
"不再受支持。考虑使用以下命令删除 oid 列:\n"
"    ALTER TABLE ... SET WITHOUT OIDS;\n"
"有问题的表列在以下文件中:\n"
"    %s"

#: check.c:1764
#, c-format
msgid "Checking for not-null constraint inconsistencies"
msgstr "正在检查非空约束的不一致"

#: check.c:1791
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Your installation contains inconsistent NOT NULL constraints.\n"
"If the parent column(s) are NOT NULL, then the child column must\n"
"also be marked NOT NULL, or the upgrade will fail.\n"
"You can fix this by running\n"
"    ALTER TABLE tablename ALTER column SET NOT NULL;\n"
"on each column listed in the file:\n"
"    %s"
msgstr ""
"您的安装中存在不一致的 NOT NULL 约束。\n"
"如果父表的列为 NOT NULL，子表的对应列也必须标记为 NOT NULL，\n"
"否则升级将失败。可以运行以下命令来修复:\n"
"    ALTER TABLE tablename ALTER column SET NOT NULL;\n"
"对以下文件中列出的每一列都执行此操作:\n"
"    %s"

#: check.c:1850
#, c-format
msgid "Checking for uses of gist_inet_ops/gist_cidr_ops"
msgstr "正在检查 gist_inet_ops/gist_cidr_ops 的使用情况"

#: check.c:1866
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Your installation contains indexes that use the btree_gist extension's\n"
"gist_inet_ops or gist_cidr_ops operator classes, which cannot be\n"
"binary-upgraded.  Replace them with indexes that use the built-in GiST\n"
"inet_ops operator class.\n"
"A list of indexes with the problem is in the file:\n"
"    %s"
msgstr ""
"您的安装包含使用 btree_gist 扩展的\n"
"gist_inet_ops 或 gist_cidr_ops 操作符类的索引，\n"
"这些索引不能进行二进制升级。用采用内置 GiST\n"
"inet_ops 操作符类的索引替换它们。\n"
"有问题的索引列在以下文件中:\n"
"    %s"

#: check.c:1893
#, c-format
msgid "Checking for roles starting with \"pg_\""
msgstr "正在检查以 \"pg_\" 开头的角色"

#: check.c:1924
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Your installation contains roles starting with \"pg_\".\n"
"\"pg_\" is a reserved prefix for system roles.  The cluster\n"
"cannot be upgraded until these roles are renamed.\n"
"A list of roles starting with \"pg_\" is in the file:\n"
"    %s"
msgstr ""
"您的安装包含以 \"pg_\" 开头的角色。\n"
"\"pg_\" 是系统角色的保留前缀。在重命名\n"
"这些角色之前不能升级集簇。\n"
"以 \"pg_\" 开头的角色列在以下文件中:\n"
"    %s"

#: check.c:1975
#, c-format
msgid "Checking for user-defined encoding conversions"
msgstr "正在检查用户定义的编码转换"

#: check.c:2004
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Your installation contains user-defined encoding conversions.\n"
"The conversion function parameters changed in PostgreSQL version 14\n"
"so this cluster cannot currently be upgraded.  You can remove the\n"
"encoding conversions in the old cluster and restart the upgrade.\n"
"A list of user-defined encoding conversions is in the file:\n"
"    %s"
msgstr ""
"您的安装包含用户定义的编码转换。\n"
"转换函数参数在 PostgreSQL 14 中已发生变化，\n"
"因此当前不能升级此集簇。可以删除\n"
"旧集簇中的编码转换，然后重新开始升级。\n"
"用户定义的编码转换列在以下文件中:\n"
"    %s"

#: check.c:2089
#, c-format
msgid "Checking for objects affected by Unicode update"
msgstr "正在检查受 Unicode 更新影响的对象"

#: check.c:2188 version.c:139
#, c-format
msgid "warning"
msgstr "警告"

#: check.c:2189
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Your installation contains relations that might be affected by a new version "
"of Unicode.\n"
"A list of potentially-affected relations is in the file:\n"
"    %s"
msgstr ""
"您的安装包含可能受新版 Unicode 影响的关系。\n"
"可能受影响的关系列在以下文件中:\n"
"    %s"

#: check.c:2240
#, c-format
msgid "Checking new cluster replication slots"
msgstr "正在检查新集簇的复制槽"

#: check.c:2252
#, c-format
msgid "could not count the number of replication slots"
msgstr "无法统计复制槽数量"

#: check.c:2262
#, c-format
msgid "expected 0 logical replication slots but found %d"
msgstr "预期为 0 个逻辑复制槽，实际为 %d 个"

#: check.c:2271
#, c-format
msgid "replication slot \"%s\" already exists in the new cluster"
msgstr "新集簇中已存在复制槽 \"%s\""

#: check.c:2281 check.c:2418
#, c-format
msgid "could not determine parameter settings on new cluster"
msgstr "无法确定新集簇的参数设置"

#: check.c:2287
#, c-format
msgid "\"wal_level\" must be \"replica\" or \"logical\" but is set to \"%s\""
msgstr "\"wal_level\" 必须为 \"replica\" 或 \"logical\"，但当前设为 \"%s\""

#: check.c:2309
#, c-format
msgid "could not parse \"output_plugin_libraries\" setting '%s'"
msgstr "无法解析 \"output_plugin_libraries\" 设置 '%s'"

#: check.c:2356
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Your installation contains logical replication slots with plugins\n"
"that are not allowed by the new cluster's output_plugin_libraries\n"
"setting. You can add trusted plugins to output_plugin_libraries\n"
"and/or remove affected slots, and then restart the upgrade.\n"
"A list of the problematic slots is in the file:\n"
"    %s"
msgstr ""
"您的安装包含逻辑复制槽，但新集簇的\n"
"output_plugin_libraries 设置不允许使用其插件。\n"
"可以将受信任的插件加入 output_plugin_libraries，\n"
"和/或删除受影响的槽，然后重新开始升级。\n"
"有问题的槽列在以下文件中:\n"
"    %s"

#: check.c:2372
#, c-format
msgid ""
"\"max_replication_slots\" (%d) must be greater than or equal to the number "
"of logical replication slots in the old cluster plus one additional slot "
"required for retaining conflict detection information (%d)"
msgstr ""
"\"max_replication_slots\"（%d）必须大于等于旧集簇的逻辑复制槽数量与保留冲突检"
"测信息所需的一个额外槽之和（%d）"

#: check.c:2378
#, c-format
msgid ""
"\"max_replication_slots\" (%d) must be greater than or equal to the number "
"of logical replication slots (%d) in the old cluster"
msgstr ""
"\"max_replication_slots\"（%d）必须大于等于旧集簇中的逻辑复制槽数量（%d）"

#: check.c:2410
#, c-format
msgid "Checking new cluster configuration for subscriptions"
msgstr "正在检查新集簇的订阅配置"

#: check.c:2422
#, c-format
msgid ""
"\"max_active_replication_origins\" (%d) must be greater than or equal to the "
"number of subscriptions (%d) in the old cluster"
msgstr ""
"\"max_active_replication_origins\"（%d）必须大于等于旧集簇中的订阅数量（%d）"

#: check.c:2444
#, c-format
msgid "Checking logical replication slots"
msgstr "正在检查逻辑复制槽"

#: check.c:2512
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Your installation contains logical replication slots that cannot be "
"upgraded.\n"
"You can remove invalid slots and/or consume the pending WAL for other "
"slots,\n"
"and then restart the upgrade.\n"
"A list of the problematic slots is in the file:\n"
"    %s"
msgstr ""
"您的安装包含不能升级的逻辑复制槽。\n"
"可以删除无效槽，和/或消费其他槽尚未处理的 WAL，\n"
"然后重新开始升级。\n"
"有问题的槽列在以下文件中:\n"
"    %s"

#: check.c:2570
#, c-format
msgid "Checking subscription state"
msgstr "正在检查订阅状态"

#: check.c:2652
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Your installation contains subscriptions without origin or having relations "
"not in i (initialize) or r (ready) state.\n"
"You can allow the initial sync to finish for all relations and then restart "
"the upgrade.\n"
"A list of the problematic subscriptions is in the file:\n"
"    %s"
msgstr ""
"您的安装包含没有复制源的订阅，或关系状态不为 i（初始化）或 r（就绪）的订"
"阅。\n"
"可以等待所有关系完成初始同步，然后重新开始升级。\n"
"有问题的订阅列在以下文件中:\n"
"    %s"

#: check.c:2678
#, c-format
msgid "Checking names of databases, roles, and tablespaces"
msgstr "正在检查数据库、角色和表空间的名称"

#: check.c:2721
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Your installation contains databases, roles, or tablespaces with names\n"
"with invalid characters (newline or carriage return).  To fix this,\n"
"rename these objects.\n"
"A list of all objects with invalid names is in the file:\n"
"    %s"
msgstr ""
"您的安装包含名称中带有无效字符\n"
"（换行符或回车符）的数据库、角色或表空间。\n"
"重命名这些对象以修复此问题。\n"
"所有名称无效的对象列在以下文件中:\n"
"    %s"

